stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Evaluating : Context Validation Triggered
    
    Evaluating --> Valid : Checks pass
    Evaluating --> ValidWithWarnings : Low confidence/stale warnings exist
    Evaluating --> RequiresEnrichment : Missing optional metrics
    Evaluating --> RequiresManualReview : Unresolved telemetry contradictions
    Evaluating --> Invalid : Critical safety policy missing
    
    Valid --> [*]
    ValidWithWarnings --> [*]
    RequiresEnrichment --> [*]
    RequiresManualReview --> [*]
    Invalid --> [*]
